{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a294fbd02043773cf94c91f7358495880aaa34db9d91c3fa49e4a729242f345e", "ja": "（あずささんと琴葉が主演を務めるドラマの撮影中。\n休憩時間に、次のシーンの下見にきた……）", "zh": "（正在拍摄由应梓小姐和琴叶主演的电视剧。休息时间，我来查看下一场戏的场地……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "88d63156d25abe75f680a574a5067168041d7ea69329be8419564739394ec020", "ja": "ううっ、聞いてた以上に雰囲気があるわね……。\n琴葉ちゃん、どうかしら？", "zh": "呜呜，比听说的还要有气氛呢……\n琴叶，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "d854e859a73025bfd83519d672fc87e220ecf8e49607bc314c5d7e15e4b66d5b", "ja": "は、はい。怖いですけど、これぐらいなら……。\n役に入ってしまえば、気にならない……かも？", "zh": "是、是的。虽然有点可怕，但这种程度的话……\n只要进入角色，或许就不会在意了……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7999824f7e81f709392e7c9b04631bb98a4ae9b344b13f4ec65539479c5af11", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n撮影の時は、もっと遅い時間なんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n拍摄的时候，要更晚一些，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4346ca0f9de36914f94f8772462d1b0186a5e4258ae9b725f9837c9d5d9b1d24", "ja": "そうだな。撮影時間帯は夕方だけど、夜に見えるように\nセッティングする、とは聞いているよ。", "zh": "是啊。我听说拍摄时间是在傍晚，但会布置成看起来像夜晚的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "c1c28bbc96c20f31cb3b6041d091c57c6eb26a860a53383c9cb7bda2e577c51f", "ja": "じゃあ、きっと今よりも\nもっと……なんでしょうね……。", "zh": "那么，一定会比现在更加……该怎么说呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b7f157092a4c01a5a5a1ee1cbdd3b5ea8b3a383038cdc522321007f4ed6bc68e", "ja": "小道具も追加されるので、そうだと思います。\nふたりとも、大丈……。", "zh": "还会追加道具，我想应该确实会那样。\n你们两个，没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1007_null", "source_sha256": "7d850030dd70cff1f2e16c4eb15a38d35b80a137be5a879124714f0f0ce501bb", "ja": "ガタッ！\n……ガタガタッ！", "zh": "咔哒！\n……咔哒咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "39f2449be0b82851e8f601af77b020a9dcddcb431d536f64124f980dbdd600ab", "ja": "きゃ……！", "zh": "呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "39f2449be0b82851e8f601af77b020a9dcddcb431d536f64124f980dbdd600ab", "ja": "きゃ……！", "zh": "呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "a33d8bc41df3d304c1c8f1720b1937fe091ee9171a8f3e78ffd62234bbe6524f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nい、今の音、もしかして……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n刚、刚才的声音，难道是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f73bc46c8fb12b11d707c03fe06c63e4ad312f63db43b974e4599ddf8ac39351", "ja": "大丈夫です。風の音……だと思います。\nさっき来た時も風が強かったじゃないですか。", "zh": "没事的。我想……应该只是风声吧。\n刚才过来的时候，风不也挺大的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "a219fb8252fbf6d1315ba1ca1e906df90e66dcd8e11fa72a1dde634161a4ce80", "ja": "そそそ、そうでしたね！　あ、あずささん、\n{$P$}の言う通りです！", "zh": "对对对、确实是这样！啊，秋、秋月姐姐，正如{$P$}所说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "3e1ec942e3ec5c0ac0fe5fc3e0f803b93124398c0424d7b98a72750bbabc5015", "ja": "けど……今の反応は、シスター失格です。\nゴーストと戦う役なのに、怖がってばかりで。", "zh": "可是……刚才那种反应，根本不配当修女。\n明明是负责和鬼魂战斗的，却一直只顾着害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c4aa2cf8f9ad223b49112cbfad251a0cb675880d21bf5ca5830abc8c362fe62", "ja": "うーん……撮影が始まれば、また変わると思うけどな。\nこういうのは、慣れの問題な気もするし。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得等拍摄开始了，应该就会有所改变吧。\n这种事感觉也和习惯有关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6fbd798152a099ce97cd50965e59a6ac66d9f9ec358d2e96c0c6b9188ba2c73", "ja": "慣れの問題……あっ！　今度、お化け屋敷に行って、\n特訓をするっていうのはどうかしら？", "zh": "这是习惯问题……啊！下次去鬼屋特训，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ce73e3396f619ff246d38e283ae929939311e931915a2031f81062e1c29c407", "ja": "お、お化け屋敷ですか！？　うう……\n怖いですけど、演技に必要なら頑張ります。", "zh": "鬼屋！？呜呜……  \n虽然很害怕，但如果是演技所需要的，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "c03fc9b4da10369c54d0ec1d815d9e188a86f61e8ba601974e70544cff69a3d9", "ja": "ええ。それに、{$P$}さんが\n一緒なら、心強いですしね♪", "zh": "嗯。而且，有{$P$}先生一起的话，也会觉得安心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1018_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "f26a457998a7359c29daca78e0e97af40022f9cfe665ec482d277767f52c75ac", "ja": "ぜ、ぜひお願いします……！　私たちふたりだけだと、\nゴールまでたどり着ける気がしないので……！", "zh": "当、当然拜托您了……！只有我们两个人的话，总觉得没办法到达终点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "5abfb627205ca915fc898d6a600beab8ea98ba4e4b47172f429642f944f41e50", "ja": "私からもお願いです～。{$P$}さんが\n一緒なら、勇気を出せると思いますので……！", "zh": "我也拜托您了～。有{$P$}先生在一起的话，我想我能鼓起勇气来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0434_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d43cfe8cbbf060254ffc96f6d98e77537b48a70c7d96892ff071c778512f6518", "ja": "（特訓の約束をして、現場に戻った。休憩後の撮影は\n二人とも絶好調！　下見が気分転換になったのかな？）", "zh": "（和她们约好特训后，回到了现场。休息后的拍摄状态绝佳！难道是提前踩点让她们转换了心情？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
